### Informational Questions

Focus on:

- Definitions
- Explanations
- Educational answers


### Commercial Questions

Focus on:

- Comparisons
- Reviews
- Recommendations


### Transactional Questions

Focus on:

- Purchase decisions
- Service requests
- Actions


